Changes made in Voxie (see the git history from commit dc3e568 on):
- Listen first, greeting from the agent, ending the call after the last line.
- Sarvam speech-to-text (REST and streaming); an AssemblyAI message-size fix.
- Backchannels that don't cut the agent off; turn-taking in other languages.
- Failover speech-to-text, and an adaptive listener that chooses and switches
  speech-to-text per call by the caller's language (Groq Whisper and Sarvam
  identification; audio replay across a switch).
- Agent replies voiced sentence by sentence; [lang:xx] language tags.
- Fixes to the bundled VibeVoice sidecars for a fully local setup.
- Phone calls through Twilio Media Streams (internal/twilio/), on a media
  interface that WebRTC calls now use too (internal/pipeline/media.go).
- New: voice-router/ (Kokoro + Sarvam text-to-speech), configs/,
  examples/quickstart/, tools/callers/, compose.yaml, docs/voxie/.

